(a) The owner must submit the information required on the city's short-term rental permit application form provided by the city, which may include the following:
(1) The name, address, and 24-hour telephone numbers of the owner of the subject short-term rental unit;
(2) The name, address, and 24-hour telephone numbers of the owner's authorized agent or representative, if any;
